stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Return Material Authorisation \(RMA\) Process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: sup-rma-process-v2 | Version: 2 | Effective: 2025-04-01 | Supersedes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (sup-rma-process-v1 | Owner: Customer Support \(Rosa Delgado\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (This procedure describes how customers and partners return Halcyon, Tessera and Lumen products) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (to Meridian Instruments for repair, warranty replacement or evaluation. No product may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (returned without a valid Return Material Authorisation \(RMA\) number. Shipments that arrive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (without an RMA number are refused at goods-in.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 577 Td (2. Requesting an RMA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 555 Td (1. Log in to the Meridian Support Centre \(MSC\) portal at support.meridian-instruments.com.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542 Td (2. Open, or locate, the MSC ticket describing the fault. Every RMA must be linked to an MSC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 529 Td (   ticket, for example MSC-2025-018842. RMA requests without a linked ticket are rejected.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 516 Td (3. From the ticket, select Request RMA and enter the serial numbers, the fault description,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 503 Td (   any error code shown \(for example E-117, T-327 or L-222\) and the return address.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 490 Td (4. For claims involving physical damage \(cracked housings, damaged flanges, broken antenna) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 477 Td (   connectors\), attach at least two photographs showing the damage and the serial number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (   label.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (5. The RMA desk approves the request within 1 business day and issues an RMA number in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (   format RMA-YYYY-NNNNNN, for example RMA-2025-004127, together with the shipping label.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 425 Td (6. One RMA number covers up to 10 units of the same model with the same fault.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 412 Td (The rma@meridian-instruments.com mailbox is no longer monitored for new requests and sends an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 399 Td (automatic reply directing customers to the portal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 374 Td (3. Validity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 352 Td (An RMA number is valid for 21 days from issue. Units received after 21 days are held for 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 339 Td (business days and then returned unrepaired at the customer's cost unless the RMA is renewed in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326 Td (the portal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 301 Td (4. Returns addresses) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 280 Td (Customer region | Returns location) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 268 Td (United Kingdom | Meridian Instruments Ltd, Service Centre, Leeds, United Kingdom) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 256 Td (European Union and rest of Europe \(non-UK\) | Meridian Instruments B.V., EU Returns Hub,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 244 Td (Rotterdam, Netherlands) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 232 Td (Middle East and Africa | Meridian Instruments Ltd, Service Centre, Leeds, United Kingdom) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 220 Td (North, Central and South America | Meridian Instruments Inc., Service Centre, Austin, Texas,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 208 Td (United States) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 196 Td (Asia-Pacific | Meridian Instruments Sdn Bhd, Service Centre, Penang, Malaysia) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 174 Td (The Rotterdam hub removes customs delays for EU customers after the UK's exit from the EU.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 161 Td (Units needing component-level repair may be forwarded from Rotterdam to Leeds; this does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 148 Td (change the turnaround commitment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 126 Td (Write the RMA number clearly on the outside of every carton. Pack gas detectors with their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 113 Td (battery installed but switched off. Lumen flow meters must be drained, dried and shipped with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 100 Td (flange protection covers fitted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 75 Td (5. Decontamination declaration \(mandatory\)) Tj ET
endstream
