stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (Every return must include a completed and signed Decontamination Declaration, form MI-F-031,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (both uploaded to the RMA in the portal and placed in a clear pouch on the outside of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (carton. The form confirms which substances the product was exposed to and how it was cleaned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681 Td (Units that arrive without form MI-F-031 are quarantined unopened and returned to the customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (at the customer's cost. This applies to warranty returns too.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 643 Td (6. Advance replacement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 621 Td (Advance replacement is available to Professional and Premier support customers \(see) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 608 Td (sup-sla-tiers\). Premier replacements ship on the next business day after RMA approval. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 595 Td (faulty unit must be received within 21 days of the replacement being delivered, or the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 582 Td (replacement unit is invoiced at list price.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 557 Td (7. Assessment and turnaround) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 535 Td (On receipt, the service centre inspects the unit and classifies the return as:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 513 Td (- Warranty repair or replacement at no charge, under the warranty terms in force when the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 500 Td (   product was purchased \(see sup-warranty-terms-2025\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 487 Td (- Chargeable repair, for which a quotation is posted to the MSC ticket and must be approved) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 474 Td (   within 15 business days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 461 Td (- No fault found, which carries an inspection fee of GBP 95 \(EUR 110, USD 120, MYR 550\) for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 448 Td (   units outside warranty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 435 Td (The target turnaround is 10 business days from receipt to dispatch for warranty repairs and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (from quotation approval for chargeable repairs. Status updates are posted to the linked MSC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (ticket at each stage: Received, In assessment, Awaiting approval, In repair, Dispatched.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (Halcyon instruments are returned with a fresh calibration certificate. Tessera gateways are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 383 Td (reset to factory defaults and returned with the current gateway firmware, 5.3.0.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 358 Td (8. Shipping costs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 336 Td (For warranty returns, Meridian pays inbound shipping using the portal-generated label and pays) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 323 Td (outbound shipping. For chargeable repairs, the customer pays inbound shipping and outbound) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 310 Td (shipping is added to the quotation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 285 Td (9. Changes from the previous version) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 264 Td (Item | Version 1 \(February 2024\) | Version 2 \(April 2025\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 252 Td (How to request | Email to rma@meridian-instruments.com | MSC portal, linked MSC ticket required) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 240 Td (RMA number format | RMA-24-NNNNN | RMA-YYYY-NNNNNN) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 228 Td (RMA validity | 30 days | 21 days) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 216 Td (EU \(non-UK\) returns | Leeds | Rotterdam EU Returns Hub) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 204 Td (Decontamination declaration | Recommended | Mandatory, form MI-F-031; units without it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 192 Td (quarantined and returned at customer cost) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 180 Td (Photos for damage claims | Not required | At least two photos required) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 168 Td (Advance replacement | Premier only | Professional and Premier) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 156 Td (Target turnaround | 15 business days | 10 business days) Tj ET
endstream
